  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 78c39ca0aa3b4c60ad7cb11e9f4cf262, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialTopic_Development
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Features.Tutorial.Data.TutorialTopicData
  <Title>k__BackingField: Town Development
  <Chapters>k__BackingField:
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Development Trend
    <Description>k__BackingField: "Each town has a development gauge that reflects
      its growth over time. Supplying foreign goods, completing missions and building
      production increases the town\u2019s development trend."
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 65dc82cb32e094343af93995340cd60b, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Milestones & Growth
    <Description>k__BackingField: 'Reaching development milestones increases the
      towns stats and unlocks new opportunities. Each town tier enables a new set
      of milestones. '
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 5283cf0602f9e1f4fa3de6fa522ef20b, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Missions
    <Description>k__BackingField: Towns will occasionally request certain goods.
      Fulfilling these requests will aid their development.Failing to supply requested
      goods in time will set the town back in its development.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 7dfecc8add197ff4387bdfb6cf0ebf06, type: 3}
  - <Title>k__BackingField: Town Ugrade
    <Description>k__BackingField: When a town reaches 100 development, it will start
      a special mission which upgrades the town, should you manage to supply the
      required goods in time. Pay special attention to these missions as these will
      win or lose you the game.
    <Image>k__BackingField: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 7dfecc8add197ff4387bdfb6cf0ebf06, type: 3}
